767130","kind":"announcement","title":"Dig Deeper! King in the Mountain Joins Steam Next Fest with an Improved Demo","summary":"Howdy, everyone!King in the Mountain is officially participating in Steam Next Fest from October 19 to 26! The new demo v0.90 is available on Steam, and I'm excited to welcome new players into the mountain!King in the Mountain is a relaxing incremental mining and resource management game about rebuilding a fallen dwarven kingdom, one expedition at a time. Your Kingdom Awaits Beneath the MountainAs an exiled king, you'll guide your dwarves underground in search of valuable resources and ancient t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:51:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691937","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4767130-1844751498224511","game_id":"steam-4767130","kind":"update","title":"Hotfix v0.71","summary":"Small balancing tweaks:Added an explosion animationAdded more information at the end of the demo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T13:12:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498224511","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4767130-1844751498219112","game_id":"steam-4767130","kind":"announcement","title":"King in the Mountain’s First Steam Demo Is Out Now!","summary":"Howdy everyone! The first Steam demo for King in the Mountain is now LIVE!It’s time to head back into the mountain. Plan your dwarves’ mining expeditions, manage your resources, and rebuild the Mountain Hall - one haul at a time.A huge thank you to everyone who joined our August public playtest and shared their feedback. Your suggestions helped shape this demo, and I'm excited for you to try the changes! Play the Demo Now Watch the Official Demo Trailer Your Kingdom Starts with the Next Expediti","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T17:08:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498219112","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4767130-1846651706680549","game_id":"steam-4767130","kind":"announcement","title":"King in the Mountain Public Playtest Is Ending Today","summary":"Howdy everyone!After two weeks of digging, building, and upgrading, the King in the Mountain Public Playtest is coming to an end today.A huge thank you to everyone who took part!Please remember to wishlist the game:Most importantly, thank you to everyone who took the time to share feedback, report bugs, and tell us what worked and what didn’t. That feedback is exactly why we run these playtests, and we’ll be going through everything we’ve collected as we continue development.What's Next?Once the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T08:57:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706680549","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4767130-1840944183789213","game_id":"steam-4767130","kind":"announcement","title":"King in the Mountain - Public Playtest Is LIVE!","summary":"Howdy everyone!The King in the Mountain Public Playtest is now LIVE on Steam!From August 18 through August 25, you can head into the mountain, send your dwarves on mining expeditions, rebuild the Mountain Hall, experiment with upgrades, and help us shape the game ahead of release.Play the Public Playtest Now:Watch the Official Steam Playtest TrailerIn King in the Mountain, you send teams of dwarves underground in search 